    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the cockpit windshield assembly, its retainer strip and rivets, the frame splice plate and spar cap, and the heater termination hardware at the lower sill.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the cockpit windshield assembly and the frame parts that carry it, including the retainer strip, the sealing land members and the hardware at the heater termination.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows the left forward windshield; the right side is a mirror image and the side windows are covered by a separate figure. The heater termination hardware at items 70 and 80 is shown on sheet 2 with the internal trim removed, because it is only accessible from inside the flight compartment. The rivets at item 40 are single use and must be renewed at every windshield change; quantities are given for one window."
    },
